<a href=\"/wiki/Scarlet_Mask\" title=\"Scarlet Mask\">Scarlet</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"position\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Position</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Housekeeper</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Relationships</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"affiliation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Affiliation</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Order_of_St._George\" title=\"The Order of St. George\">The Order of St. George</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"relatives\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Relatives</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Charlotte_Cutter\" title=\"Charlotte Cutter\">Charlotte Cutter</a> † <small>(ward)</small></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Appearances</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"first_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">First Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_22\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 22\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #22</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"last_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Last Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Book_of_Cutter_1\" title=\"Book of Cutter 1\">Book of Cutter</a></i></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<blockquote class=\"pull-quote\">\n\t<div class=\"pull-quote&#95;&#95;text\">Read your books, but do yourself a favor and <i>listen.</i> You'll learn a thing or two about the game, and <i>your place</i> in it.</div>\n\t<p style=\"text-align: right\"><cite>—Albie Cutter to <a href=\"/wiki/Maxine_Slaughter\" title=\"Maxine Slaughter\">Maxine Slaughter</a>, <i><a href=\"/wiki/Book_of_Cutter_1\" title=\"Book of Cutter 1\">Book of Cutter</a></i></cite></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><b>Albert \"Albie\" Cutter</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Scarlet_Mask\" title=\"Scarlet Mask\">Scarlet Mask</a> positioned in the <span class=\"new\" title=\"House of Cutter (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvSG91c2Vfb2ZfQ3V0dGVyP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">House of Cutter</span> under <a href=\"/wiki/The_Order_of_St._George\" title=\"The Order of St. George\">The Order of St. George</a>. As the keeper of the house, he had an intimate knowledge of the secrets of both its residents and guests. Following the death of his charge, <a href=\"/wiki/Charlotte_Cutter\" title=\"Charlotte Cutter\">Charlotte Cutter</a>, he became bitter towards the <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Slaughter\" title=\"House of Slaughter\">House of Slaughter</a>, who had requested her assistance in the failed assassination of <a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">Erica Slaughter</a>.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Past\">Past</span></h3>\n<p>At some point, Albie was recruited into <a href=\"/wiki/The_Order_of_St._George\" title=\"The Order of St. George\">The Order of St. George</a> under the <span class=\"new\" title=\"House of Cutter (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvSG91c2Vfb2ZfQ3V0dGVyP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">House of Cutter</span>. He became a <a href=\"/wiki/Scarlet_Mask\" title=\"Scarlet Mask\">Scarlet Mask</a>, and was the keeper of the entire House, learning quickly how to discern secrets and plans from its members. He also raised <a href=\"/wiki/Charlotte_Cutter\" title=\"Charlotte Cutter\">Charlotte Cutter</a> from childhood into her position as a <a href=\"/wiki/Black_Mask\" title=\"Black Mask\">Black Mask</a>, and she was considered his \"special favorite.\"<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-BOC&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-BOC-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Tribulation_Incident_and_Aftermath\">Tribulation Incident and Aftermath</span></h3>\n<p>In 2021, Albie sent Charlotte word that she had been assigned to kill a renegade hunter in America.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC22&#95;2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC22-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> However, Charlotte was killed by <a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">Erica Slaughter</a>, giving Albie a slight grudge against the House that had sent her to her death. It is unknown if he knows specifically of <a href=\"/wiki/Cecilia_Slaughter\" title=\"Cecilia Slaughter\">Cecilia Slaughter</a>'s involvement in Charlotte's death, but he had a specific distaste for her as well.\n</p><p>When <a href=\"/wiki/Maxine_Slaughter\" title=\"Maxine Slaughter\">Maxine Slaughter</a> trained in the House to become Slaughter's only Black Mask, Albie conversed with her, having found it interesting how interested she was in reading. When she admitted she knew she was a pawn but wanted to know more about the game she was being played in, Albie told her where to sit in order to eavesdrop on important meetings, such as the one between Cecilia and <a href=\"/wiki/Victor_Saint-Georges\" title=\"Victor Saint-Georges\">Victor Saint-Georges</a> that would happen soon. After chaperoning both guests to their place, he spotted Maxine in the spot, and said nothing before leaving.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-BOC&#95;1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-BOC-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Physical_appearance\">Physical appearance</span></h2>\n<dl><dd><i>TBA</i></dd></dl>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearances\">Appearances</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Something_Is_Killing_the_Children\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something Is Killing the Children</a></i></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_22\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 22\">Issue #22</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Books_of_Slaughter\"><i>Books of Slaughter</i></span></h3>\n<ul><li><i><a href=\"/wiki/Book_of_Cutter_1\" title=\"Book of Cutter 1\">Book of Cutter</a></i></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"d090a49a3ba185bfcc65c3d095bb612b\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"AlbieCutter-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:132px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:AlbieCutter.png\" title=\"AlbieCutter.png (1.8 MB)\" style=\"height:185px; width:132px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/1/10/AlbieCutter.png/revision/latest/scale-to-